<title>SPAIN: Spain's Pryca 1996 net profit up 10.2 pct.</title>
<headline>Spain's Pryca 1996 net profit up 10.2 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Full 1996 results for hypermarket chain group Pryca in billions of pesetas, unless stated:</p>
<p> Net taxed				23.95     vs    21.74</p>
<p> Net sales			     538.62     vs   543.37</p>
<p> Gross operating profit	     42.74     vs    38.11</p>
<p> Profit before tax		    34.49     vs    31.60</p>
<p>NOTE: Pryca said total investment in 1996 was 30.14 billion pesetas, mostly aimed at financing new hypermarkets.</p>
<p>In 1996 it opened four new retail outlets, putting the total at 53 by year end.</p>
<p>Gross sales in the period totalled 594.53 billion pesetas.</p>
</text>
